## Examples (MOST IMPORTANT)
- examples/memories/agent_memory_example.py
  - Demonstrates usage of ChatAgent with ChatHistoryMemory for longterm memory
  - Shows saving/loading memory to/from JSON file
  - Key functions: ChatAgent.step(), ChatAgent.save_memory(), ChatAgent.load_memory_from_path()

- examples/toolkits/memory_toolkit.py
  - Demonstrates usage of MemoryToolkit with ChatAgent for memory management via function calling tools
  - Key functions: MemoryToolkit.save(), MemoryToolkit.load(), MemoryToolkit.load_from_path(), MemoryToolkit.clear_memory()

- docs/cookbooks/advanced_features/agents_with_memory.ipynb
  - Notebook explaining memory usage in agents including LongtermAgentMemory
  - Shows how to set up LongtermAgentMemory with ChatHistoryBlock and VectorDBBlock
  - Shows adding LongtermAgentMemory to ChatAgent and querying it

## Implementation
- camel/memories/agent_memories.py
  - Classes: ChatHistoryMemory, VectorDBMemory, LongtermAgentMemory
  - LongtermAgentMemory combines ChatHistoryBlock and VectorDBBlock for persistent longterm memory

- camel/toolkits/memory_toolkit.py
  - Class: MemoryToolkit
  - Provides function tools to save/load/clear ChatAgent memory

- camel/agents/chat_agent.py
  - Class: ChatAgent
  - Core agent class supporting memory, tools, function calling, summarization, streaming, etc.
  - Methods for memory management: update_memory(), load_memory(), load_memory_from_path(), save_memory()

## Tests
- test/memories/test_agent_memories.py
  - Tests for LongtermAgentMemory and ChatHistoryMemory including memory retrieval, writing, clearing, and cleaning tool calls

## Configuration/Types
- camel/memories/__init__.py
  - Exports memory classes including LongtermAgentMemory, ChatHistoryMemory, VectorDBMemory
  - Exports context creators and memory blocks

